  -- cover_image and the temple_images rows below are Wikimedia Commons files, each
  -- checked with an actual image request (206 + content-type image/jpeg) before it
  -- was written here, so a dead or html-served url cannot reach the page. they are
  -- hotlinked rather than copied, which keeps this seed small and points at the
  -- freely licensed original; the file name is still on Commons, so the licence and
  -- author for each one live on that file's page. upload.wikimedia.org is allowed in
  -- next.config.ts for this reason. nothing here is on the temples table with a
  -- null image any more.
  --
  -- maps_url carries the short google.com/maps link Google itself produced, so the
  -- pin is the one the temple published rather than one guessed from the street
  -- address. tmpl-5 is the unpublished temple and keeps its null on purpose, to show
