  --
  -- timings are one column per weekday, Sunday first, because a single string
  -- cannot say which day a visitor is asking about. a blank day is hidden on the
  -- public page; "Closed" is written deliberately to say the temple is shut. most
  -- temples here keep the same hours every day, which is why several rows repeat
